  "narration": [
    {
      "text": "Task one overview? This is where most bands are lost.",
      "startFrame": 4,
      "durationInFrames": 112,
      "emphasis": false,
      "muteBed": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Four countries, two years, internet access. Do not list everything.",
      "startFrame": 120,
      "durationInFrames": 135,
      "emphasis": false,
      "muteBed": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Step one. What changed? Every country went up.",
      "startFrame": 259,
      "durationInFrames": 97,
      "emphasis": false,
      "muteBed": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Up in all four. That is your first sentence.",
      "startFrame": 371,
      "durationInFrames": 88,
      "emphasis": true,
      "muteBed": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Step two. Largest and smallest change.",
      "startFrame": 463,
      "durationInFrames": 90,
      "emphasis": false,
      "muteBed": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Brazil jumped fifty points. The UK only twenty three.",
      "startFrame": 568,
      "durationInFrames": 120,
      "emphasis": true,
      "muteBed": false
    },
    {
      "text": "So the developing economies grew fastest. That is a pattern.",
      "startFrame": 692,
      "durationInFrames": 125,
      "emphasis": false,
      "muteBed": false
    },
    {
      "text": "India stayed lowest throughout. The UK stayed highest.",
      "startFrame": 832,
      "durationInFrames": 117,
      "emphasis": true,
      "muteBed": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Step three. Put the pattern into one overview sentence.",
      "startFrame": 953,
      "durationInFrames": 109,
      "emphasis": false,
      "muteBed": false
    },
    {
      "text": "No numbers in the overview. Numbers belong in the body.",
      "startFrame": 1066,
      "durationInFrames": 117,
      "emphasis": false,
      "muteBed": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Overall, access increased in every country over the decade.",
      "startFrame": 1198,
      "durationInFrames": 125,
      "emphasis": true,
      "muteBed": false
    },
    {
      "text": "With the sharpest growth in the developing economies.",
